  <Place Angle="0" AngularSize="0" Constellation="SER2" DataSetType="Sky" Dec="1.2397815612164989" Magnitude="0" Name="Bat Shadow (2018 Observation)" Opacity="100" RA="18.49969697184502" Rotation="0" Thumbnail="https://data1.wwtassets.org/feeds/hst/heic2012a/thumb.jpg" ZoomLevel="0.29629292134837343">
    <Description>This image shows only the feature which was nicknamed the Bat Shadow. It is the shadow of a protoplanetary disc orbiting the star in the centre of the image.</Description>
